                ? 'Powered by Astro Starlight with instant CJK/EN search (⌘K), clean syntax highlighting, and curated static OpenAPI docs.'
                : '同步主仓精选核心文档与静态 OpenAPI 架构快照，内置中英文全文搜索（⌘K）、代码一键复制与去重导航。'}
            </p>
